.DS_Store
# Local-only Python virtualenv for scripts/ (see ENTITY_EXTRACTOR_PYTHON in
# README/.env.local) — was not excluded and was getting sent to the build
# context and copied into images on every build. At ~1.7 GB (torch et al.
# already installed), this was almost certainly the dominant cost in a
# 13-minute Fly build.
scripts/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
